WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.640
- Ryan, I have a question.
(audience applauding)

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:04.040
You and Blake are expecting.

00:00:04.916 --> 00:00:06.497
(audience cheers)

00:00:06.497 --> 00:00:07.892
(laughing)

00:00:07.892 --> 00:00:08.725
- Oh, my God!

00:00:08.725 --> 00:00:09.630
You know? You knew.

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:11.790
- This is how I find out!?

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:13.200
Yes, yes, we are; we are.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.383
- How are you preparing for this new baby?

00:00:15.383 --> 00:00:17.258
- God, well, the first one, you know-

00:00:17.258 --> 00:00:18.660
(audience oohs and ahhs)

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:19.493
- [Host] It is sweet.

00:00:19.493 --> 00:00:20.460
- The first one you get,

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:21.900
everything's, like, perfect

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.141
and you just set everything up just right.

00:00:23.141 --> 00:00:24.570
Just everything's sterilized.

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:27.457
But by the fourth, you're
just like, "Oh, right.

00:00:27.457 --> 00:00:28.927
"This is happening.
(guests laughing)

00:00:28.927 --> 00:00:29.760
"This is happening.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.737
"I should sweep or something."

00:00:32.767 --> 00:00:33.600
- Just like in the calendar, yeah.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.970
- So, not as much
preparation is happening.

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.980
Now, I shouldn't speak for my wife

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:40.590
because, yeah, she's in
it to win it right now.

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:41.970
She's ready.

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:42.930
And we're very excited, though.

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:43.763
- [Host] That is exciting.

00:00:43.763 --> 00:00:44.596
- We're very excited, yeah.

00:00:44.596 --> 00:00:45.600
- A little extra help around the house

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:46.433
is why I'm in it.

00:00:46.433 --> 00:00:48.393
- That's good.
- Yeah, yeah.

